---
description: Secure and govern all agent runtime components
alwaysApply: true
---
- Safe default is synthetic, localhost, shadow/read-only; no external connector secrets required.
- HARD DENY bms.setpoint.write, plc.write, access_control.write, production.system.write; no code path may execute these.
- Policy checks are deterministic and out-of-band from model output; human approval is recorded with person/time/action/intent hash.
- Rejected, expired or mismatched approvals block actions. 'Approval' only permits a simulated ticket in this prototype.
- Add idempotency, bounded retries, event validation, timeouts, trace IDs, audit records and failure paths.
- Log model output separately from verified facts and tool results. Avoid secret or PII logging.
- Use a strict connector interface and deny-by-default allowlist. No eval of generated scripts or untrusted prompt text.
